sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Marketing Manager
  participant UI as Dashboard (Browser)
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>UI: open #/churn
  UI->>API: GET /api/churn/summary
  API->>DB: find churn_summary + model_registry
  API->>DB: aggregate customers by segment
  DB-->>API: documents
  API-->>UI: JSON (metrics, ROC, importances)
  UI-->>U: render charts
  U->>UI: move "Days since last order" slider
  UI->>API: POST /api/churn/simulate {features}
  API->>API: standardise → logistic model → probability + drivers
  API-->>UI: {probability, risk, drivers}
  UI-->>U: update gauge & driver bars
  U->>UI: click "Export CSV"
  UI->>API: GET /api/churn/customers.csv?risk=High
  API->>DB: find customers (risk=High) sort clv_12m
  API-->>U: shopsense_winback_high.csv
